      "properties": {},
      "title": "How @reference syntax works",
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Image + Video References\n\n1. Upload an image: **@Image 1** supplies the subject's appearance and style.\n2. Upload a video: **@Video 1** supplies camera movement and pacing.\n3. Edit the prompt to assign a clear role to each reference, then Run.\n\nUse exactly **@Image 1** and **@Video 1**, including the space before the number. Numbering is separate for each media type: image_1 is @Image 1, video_1 is @Video 1. These are reference labels, not filenames.\n\n**task_type = reference** creates a new video. Choose **edit** to modify the input clip, or **extend** to continue it, and rewrite the prompt accordingly.\n\nNeeds a ModelArk key in Settings > BytePlus and a Comfy.org login for local video upload. Each generation is billed. Fixed seed reuses unchanged cached outputs."
      ]
    }
